      </TableRow>
      <TableRow>
      <TableCell><code>managedIdentity</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell><code>object</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell>managedIdentity defines the Azure User-assigned Managed identity. Cannot be set at the same time as <code>oauth</code>, <code>sdk</code> or <code>workloadIdentity</code>.</TableCell>
      </TableRow>
      <TableRow>
      <TableCell><code>oauth</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell><code>object</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell>oauth defines the oauth config that is being used to authenticate. Cannot be set at the same time as <code>managedIdentity</code>, <code>sdk</code> or <code>workloadIdentity</code>.<Fragment set:html={"<br>"} />It requires Prometheus &gt;= v2.48.0 or Thanos &gt;= v0.31.0.</TableCell>
      </TableRow>
      <TableRow>
      <TableCell><code>scope</code></TableCell>
