      </TableRow>
      <TableRow>
      <TableCell><code>status</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell><code>string</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell>Status is the status of the condition. Can be True, False, Unknown. More info: https://kubernetes.io/docs/reference/kubernetes-api/config-and-storage-resources/persistent-volume-claim-v1/#:~:text=state%20of%20pvc-,conditions.status,-(string)%2C%20required</TableCell>
      </TableRow>
