      <TableHead>Property</TableHead>
      <TableHead>Type</TableHead>
      <TableHead>Description</TableHead>
      </TableRow>
      </TableHeader>
      <TableBody>
      <TableRow>
      <TableCell><code>outOfOrderTimeWindow</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell><code>string</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell>outOfOrderTimeWindow defines how old an out-of-order/out-of-bounds sample can be with respect to the TSDB max time.<Fragment set:html={"<br>"} />An out-of-order/out-of-bounds sample is ingested into the TSDB as long as the timestamp of the sample is &gt;= (TSDB.MaxTime - outOfOrderTimeWindow).<Fragment set:html={"<br>"} />This is an <strong>experimental feature</strong>, it may change in any upcoming release in a breaking way.<Fragment set:html={"<br>"} />It requires Prometheus &gt;= v2.39.0 or PrometheusAgent &gt;= v2.54.0.</TableCell>
      </TableRow>
      </TableBody>
      </Table>
      <h3 id="_specupdatestrategy" class="group scroll-mt-20">.spec.updateStrategy<a href="#_specupdatestrategy" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h3>
      <dl class="my-4 space-y-2">
      <dt class="font-semibold">Description</dt>
      <dd class="ml-6 text-muted-foreground">
      <p>updateStrategy indicates the strategy that will be employed to update Pods in the StatefulSet when a revision is made to statefulset’s Pod Template.</p>
      <p>The default strategy is RollingUpdate.</p>
      </dd>
      <dt class="font-semibold">Type</dt>
      <dd class="ml-6 text-muted-foreground"><CodeBlock code={"`object`"} lang="plaintext" /></dd>
      <dt class="font-semibold">Required</dt>
      <dd class="ml-6 text-muted-foreground"><ul><li><code>type</code></li></ul></dd>
      </dl>
      <Table class="my-4">
